{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：18:49 2026-08-06 HKT<br/>發佈時間：18:49 2026-08-06 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：18:49 2026-08-06 HKT</p><p>東涌東交匯處，今日（8月6日）傍晚6時許，一部巴士與一部電單車相撞，鐵騎士倒地並被捲入巴士車底，重創昏迷。救援人員接報趕至，將男傷者救出，送北大嶼山醫院搶救。目前意外原因仍在調查，事故期間現場行車受阻，交通繁忙。</p><img alt=\"大批消防到場救援。FB：東涌逸東邨谷\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/af254bb79a62ae05a83663658e9fb751/2026-08/763824749_10240353615032951_3747080427030439356_n_1_.jpg\"/><img alt=\"大批消防到場救援。FB：Sayali Jadhav@Tung Chung Tower Communities.\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c52621ea83fca9049c5fa3ee22136d26/2026-08/vlcsnap-2026-08-06-19h15m42s129.png\"/><img alt=\"現場交通繁忙。FB：Sayali Jadhav@Tung Chung Tower Communities.\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a33f427096de9c449a326a236865771c/2026-08/vlcsnap-2026-08-06-19h20m29s154.png\"/><img alt=\"現場交通繁忙。FB：Sayali Jadhav@Tung Chung Tower Communities.\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/45e8ec91aafb2046ecc6848be4d492cf/2026-08/vlcsnap-2026-08-06-19h15m37s603.png\"/><img alt=\"傷者送北大嶼山醫院治理。資料圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7f96d8b89e9a1ed6ad6fe0d24f5a147c/2026-08/ha_lantauN.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-06T11:39:41.139661+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":189,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}